          flex (L2 = aim script, L2+R2 = anti-recoil). A script is 16 bytes:
          [1, recoilDown%, drift(-100..100), ramp x10ms, decay%/s,
           aimType 0/1 jitter/2 circle, aimSize%, aimHz, flags, 0...]
          js/zs-scripts.js turns them into named fields. ─────────────── */
